    70	Directional only. The key guard against main's drip-stir is the **compressive ∇·v** branch: a slow sparse drip merging into the pool is compressive → dissipated → no ring-up, even though it is locally sparse. The curve constants (`c_surface` floor, divergence scale, density gate) are tuned against the visual oracle before any numeric gate is pinned.
