   137	## Scope Boundaries
   138	
   139	**In scope:** the surface-weighted velocity-averaging dissipation in `g2p_water` (the XSPH-on-grid mechanism), its Params/Config plumbing, the supporting splash-path clamp relaxation with FP-safety, and the gates/perf/render validation — all on the two-field solver.
